# C54: MAXMIPLEVEL 0 with MIPFILTER POINT on a 2x magnified 8x8 texture with 4 levels (Nine is the reference)
size 16 16
rt A8R8G8B8
ds NONE
clear 1 0xff000000 1.0 0
rs CULLMODE CULL_NONE
tex 0 A8R8G8B8 8 8 4 hash 77
samp 0 MINFILTER TEXF_POINT
samp 0 MAGFILTER TEXF_POINT
samp 0 MIPFILTER TEXF_POINT
samp 0 MAXMIPLEVEL 0
tss 0 COLOROP TOP_SELECTARG1
tss 0 COLORARG1 TA_TEXTURE
tss 0 ALPHAOP TOP_SELECTARG1
tss 0 ALPHAARG1 TA_TEXTURE
mode rhw
v 0 0 0.5 1 0xffffffff 0 0.0117 0.0117
v 16 0 0.5 1 0xffffffff 0 1.0117 0.0117
v 0 16 0.5 1 0xffffffff 0 0.0117 1.0117
v 16 16 0.5 1 0xffffffff 0 1.0117 1.0117
draw TRIANGLESTRIP 2
